{
  "schemaVersion": 3,
  "minCindyVersion": "0.1.137",
  "id": "desktop-signal",
  "name": "状态红绿灯",
  "description": "显示本机任务状态",
  "whenToUse": "显示本机任务状态",
  "version": "1.4.4",
  "kind": "chip",
  "entry": "main.js",
  "launch": "resident",
  "subscribe": {
    "topics": [
      "task-state",
      "session"
    ]
  },
  "agent": {
    "hostTools": [
      "history",
      "control"
    ],
    "companions": true,
    "observe": true
  },
  "node": {
    "entry": "node/worker.cjs",
    "protocol": "json-rpc-stdio",
    "lifecycle": "resident"
  },
  "settingsHtml": "settings.html",
  "icon": "assets/icon.png",
  "releaseNotes": "• 清空任务面板时，只清除当前灯色的提示，其他两盏灯继续显示。\n• 修复伙伴完成任务后绿灯漏亮，以及刷新或重启后已读完成项重新出现的问题。\n• 新增「隐藏定时任务（Schedule）」设置，默认开启，兼容旧版定时任务。\n• 合并同一伙伴主对话在同一灯色下的重复条目，点击后直接进入伙伴对话。"
}